WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
Next up, the "New York Post" has some interesting results

2
00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:04.040
from a new survey.

3
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.250
They found that among women who admitted to cheating,

4
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.540
the most popular pet that they had,

5
00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.700
I don't know why they did this study, but it was a cat.

6
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.970 line:15%
So if you own a kitty, you're more likely to go on the prowl

7
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:17.430 line:15%
is what they're saying.

8
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.770 line:15%
And also, if you have a fish,

9
00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.220 line:15%
you might be a little slippery,

10
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.740 line:15%
'cause fish came in second.

11
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:23.573 line:15%
Oh, wow.

12
00:00:23.573 --> 00:00:25.120 line:15%
So all these women with cats

13
00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.080 line:15%
are fe-lying to their partners.

14
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.515 line:15%
Wow, wow, Ross.

15
00:00:28.515 --> 00:00:29.348 line:15%
Do you think there's anything there?

16
00:00:29.348 --> 00:00:30.987 line:15%
Do you think it's just stupid?

17
00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:33.460 line:15%
I think. (laughs)

18
00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:35.868 line:15%
I just thought that pun was so intricate.

19
00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:38.610 line:15%
(Ross laughs)
It was a multisyllabic pun.

20
00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:39.855 line:15%
Which one, on the prowl?

21
00:00:39.855 --> 00:00:41.261 line:15%
Yeah, it was on the prowl.

22
00:00:41.261 --> 00:00:42.094 line:15%
Fe-lying.

23
00:00:42.094 --> 00:00:43.490 line:15%
And Fe-lying.
Fe-lying, the fe-lying.

24
00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:44.880 line:15%
Fe-lying was impressive.

25
00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.090 line:15%
The cat, it makes sense to me 'cause it's like,

26
00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:48.190 line:15%
first of all, cats,

27
00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:52.470 line:15%
I don't know, they're a little bit of a sociopathic animal.

28
00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.380 line:15%
And like I love cats.

29
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.657 line:15%
Like we have two cats.

30
00:00:55.657 --> 00:00:57.607
I'm so in love with your cats.

31
00:00:58.563 --> 00:00:59.760
What are their names?

32
00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.130
Precious and Mr. Mustache.

33
00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:03.250
I'm guessing Mr. Mustache is the one on the left.

34
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.804
Yeah, you can guess. (laughs)

35
00:01:05.804 --> 00:01:07.590
Mr. Mustache.

36
00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.774
I dated a guy named Mr. Mustache once.

37
00:01:09.774 --> 00:01:11.810
(Mike and Drew laughing)

38
00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:12.897
But he didn't realize that was his name.

39
00:01:12.897 --> 00:01:14.480
No, no!
No, no.

40
00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:19.003
No, but cats have this thing,

41
00:01:21.478 --> 00:01:23.410
where I was trying to write a will.

42
00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:24.243
Have you ever written a will?

43
00:01:24.243 --> 00:01:25.076
Oh my gosh.
I have, and I need

44
00:01:25.076 --> 00:01:26.800
to update it.
It's a terrifying thing.

45
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.510
'Cause some of the people I left stuff to,

46
00:01:28.510 --> 00:01:29.499
I gotta change that.

47
00:01:29.499 --> 00:01:31.480
(Everyone laughing)

48
00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.840
I just updated mine.

49
00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:33.673
Yeah, yeah.

50
00:01:33.673 --> 00:01:35.990
I was writing a will and it was like, pets.

51
00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:37.130
