56
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:50.500
But my experience with cats

57
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.940
is like they really do judge you,

58
00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.770 line:15%
especially when you're taking a shower.

59
00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:54.810 line:15%
They're like, "Oh yeah?

60
00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:56.180 line:15%
You're gonna use that much water?

61
00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:57.630 line:15%
